       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CELSIUSTOFAHRENHEIT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 CELSIUS PIC S9(3) VALUE 100.
       01 FAHRENHEIT PIC S9(4)V9.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE FAHRENHEIT = CELSIUS * 9 / 5 + 32
           DISPLAY "FAHRENHEIT: " FAHRENHEIT
           STOP RUN.
